  "testId": "testClasses.webstore.quickOrder.QuickOrderWithSingleSkuTest#singleSkuVerifyQuickOrderPageQuantityForSelectedProductFromAutoSuggestions",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Selects a product from the Quick Order fly-out auto-suggestion, checks its default quantity, sets quantity 2, adds to cart and checks the cart count and the cart line name, unit price, quantity and total; then empties the cart.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore, click Quick Order",
      "Select value0 SKU from the auto-suggestion; verify quantity = value0 SKUQuantity (1)",
      "Set quantity value1 SKUQuantity (2); Add to Cart",
      "Verify cart heading; cart icon count = 2",
      "Verify cart line name, price, quantity and total",
      "Remove all items"
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "store",
      "product",
      "cart"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Guest cart: product x2 added, then removed"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Quantity field = 1 after selection",
      "Cart icon count = 2",
      "Line name = product name",
      "Line price = product price",
      "Line quantity = 2",
      "Line total = price x 2"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Independent method (priority 5, no dependsOn): opens the webstore itself and empties the cart at the end.",
      "value0 SKU z-1234576 (quickOrderPage!B3): SimpleProduct 'Frigidaire 5,000 BTU Window-Mounted Air Conditioner' (= value0 ProductName, D3), OutOfStockOptions DisablePurchasing, MinimumQuantity 1 / MaximumQuantity 100 (tda rows). Need product = PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK {quantityUsed 2, minMaxQuantity 2, maxPersonalizableAttributes 0 (Quick Order rejects personalizable products), store}, preferred value0 SKU (not required).",
      "Outputs: sku (auto-suggestion search), name (cart line name), salesPrice, else retailPrice (cart unit price '$165.00', as the Selenium shoppingCart simple entries). Line total '$330.00' is expected-output: price x quantity, computed by the migrated test from the price output and the typed quantity.",
      "value0 SKUQuantity 1 (default quantity after selection), value1 SKUQuantity 2 (typed) and value0 Quantity 2 (cart line quantity) are config. REVIEW: the default quantity 1 may be the product's MinimumQuantity; a fallback product with MinimumQuantity > 1 would show that (the migrated test could assert product.minQuantity).",
      "Store: openWebstoreUrl opens automation_webStoreUrl (atstage: webstore-z10-atstage, the main store MaxwellsHardware), the same store as the Selenium shoppingCart entries and the Playwright quick-order entries.",
      "Profile: work/profiles/profile.json (2026-11-01) was not run for these Selenium tests (profiled false); product facts come from bin/tda rows dbo.ZnodePimProduct (2026-11-05) and the approved Playwright quick-order entries.",
      "Scanned constant values (locators, report messages, delays) are framework constants: role config, no need.",
      "migrate: Selenium reads Excel tables through TestData.getMap; there is no swap for Selenium."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
